                            <comment id="16536909" author="andmed" created="Mon, 9 Jul 2018 13:24:32 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;TC&#160;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewQueued.html?itemId=1468905&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewQueued.html?itemId=1468905&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16536910" author="andmed" created="Mon, 9 Jul 2018 13:25:04 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;As I can see, lastEntry is absent only when cpPages == 0 and cpEntry == null for the first time, so no checkpoint is written. We also do not log checkpoint in org/apache/ignite/internal/processors/cache/persistence/GridCacheDatabaseSharedManager.java:3192 since hasDelta == false&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;So we just exit early.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
